---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';



const articleLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "BirkyStudio vs Top Producer (2026 Comparison), a Per-Seat CRM You Rent vs an Operator That Answers",
  "description": "Honest head-to-head comparison of BirkyStudio vs Top Producer for real estate agents. Top Producer is an established real estate CRM and marketing platform from $179 per user per month on annual contracts. BirkyStudio is a done-for-you AI operator that answers your phone, replies on WhatsApp, follows up automatically, and hands you verified prospects. Real pricing, real reviews, no bias.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Luna Jerney",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Birky Studio",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com"
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-10-13",
  "dateModified": "2026-10-13"
});

const faqLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Top Producer more expensive than BirkyStudio?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Top Producer is priced per user, every month, on an annual contract. The Pro plan is $179 per user per month, about $2,148 a year for one agent, and it does not include a website, lead routing, or IDX. Add a website ($35 per user per month) and FiveStreet ($25 per user per month) and a working stack starts around $239 per user per month, or roughly $2,868 a year, before any lead package. BirkyStudio is a one-time build: The Base Agent is $1,297 solo (Notion CRM included), the Text Receptionist is $297, and the Voice Receptionist is $550 plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month. Higher upfront, no per-seat fee, nothing to renew."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Top Producer answer my phone or reply on WhatsApp?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Top Producer is a real estate CRM and marketing platform, not an AI agent. It stores contacts, sends automated SMS and email lead responses, tracks transactions, and produces branded MLS market reports, but it does not answer an inbound phone call and does not hold an AI conversation on WhatsApp. BirkyStudio's Voice Receptionist is $550 one-time (plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month) and answers calls 24/7 in English and Spanish. The WhatsApp Text Receptionist is $297 one-time."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does Top Producer cost per year?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Top Producer Pro is $179 per user per month, so about $2,148 per user per year. Pro + Leads starts from $479 per month (varies with lead volume), Pro + Farming from $599 per month (varies with farm size), Pro Teams 5 is $399 per month for up to 5 users, Pro Teams 10 is $699 per month for up to 10 users, and Pro Teams 25 is $1,199 per month for up to 25 users. A website is $35 per user per month and FiveStreet lead routing is about $25 per user per month. Prices verified on topproducer.com/pricing in October 2026."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Top Producer have a free trial?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Top Producer does not publish a free trial, and reviewers on Capterra and SelectHub confirm none is offered. Sales reps sometimes offer to let you pay for the first month and cancel within 30 days, but reviewers report delays and resistance at cancellation. BirkyStudio offers a free 15-minute audit up front and a 30-day money-back guarantee on the build, with no contract to escape."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Top Producer include a website?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Not in the base plan. Top Producer Pro is the CRM and market snapshot only. A Top Producer website is an add-on at $35 per user per month, and IDX integration is not included and requires third-party tools. BirkyStudio builds a website you own, starting at $499 for a 1 to 3 page Starter site, $999 for a Professional 4 to 7 page bilingual site, and $1,999 for a Premium 10+ page site with a blog. You own the code, so nobody can hold your site or domain to ransom."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Top Producer find me leads?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Top Producer sells lead packages, but the reviews are brutal. The pattern repeats across Trustpilot, Software Advice, and G2: a guaranteed number of leads that does not arrive, leads outside the requested area, numbers that do not connect, and a contract that locks you in when you try to cancel. BirkyStudio's Verified Prospect List is a real, enriched, scored list built for your niche and area ($497 Starter, $997 Pro, one-time), and the $1,997 Lead Generation Pack adds outreach plus the AI that catches the replies around the clock. You own the list, so there is nothing to cancel."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the difference between a CRM and an AI agent?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A CRM is where you store and organize contacts. It only does something when you sit down and work it. An AI agent acts on its own. BirkyStudio's Base Agent reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it to the Notion CRM, answers it instantly, and follows up automatically in English and Spanish. Top Producer holds the information, produces market reports, and helps you market to your database. The AI agent is the one picking up at 9pm while you are at dinner."
      }
    }
  ]
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BirkyStudio vs Top Producer (2026)"
  description="BirkyStudio vs Top Producer honest comparison for real estate agents. Top Producer is an established CRM from $179 per user per month on annual contracts. BirkyStudio is a done-for-you AI operator that answers your phone, replies on WhatsApp and hands you verified prospects."
  image="/images/comparison/topproducer.jpg"
  >
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={articleLD} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={faqLD} />

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section style="padding:100px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
    <div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%,rgba(255,45,149,0.15),transparent 50%),radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%,rgba(255,45,149,0.1),transparent 50%);"></div>
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
      <div style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:100px;color:white;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Updated October 2026 • Honest comparison
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.15;">
        BirkyStudio vs Top Producer<br>
        <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-accent),var(--bs-accent));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">A Per-Seat CRM You Rent vs an Operator That Answers</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;">
        Top Producer is one of the longest-running names in real estate software, with deep MLS integration across 320+ boards, branded market reports, and built-in transaction management. It is also priced per user, every month, on an annual contract, from $179 a month, and it does not answer your phone. BirkyStudio is not a per-seat CRM. We hand you an AI operator that answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7 in English and Spanish, follows up automatically, and delivers verified prospects you own. One is software you log into and work, on a contract you cannot easily leave. The other works while you are out showing. Here is the honest breakdown.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section style="padding:80px 0">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">

      <!-- Quick Answer -->
      <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-bg-raised),var(--bs-bg-raised));border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:64px;border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);">
        <h2 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">⚡ Quick Answer</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose BirkyStudio if:</strong> You want the phone answered and the follow-up handled without you, and you would rather own your tools than rent them per seat. You get an AI agent that replies to every enquiry in seconds, an AI receptionist on WhatsApp and voice, verified prospects you own, and a website you control. Best for solo agents and small teams drowning in admin, not short of contacts.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose Top Producer if:</strong> Your business runs on MLS data and market reports, you want 320+ MLS board integrations, branded Market Snapshot reports, and built-in transaction management in one place, and your brokerage or team is already standardized on it. It is a real, established platform, and its MLS depth is the strongest card it holds.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">The honest difference:</strong> Top Producer is where your real estate data lives. It does not answer them. It stores contacts, sends automated SMS and email responses, tracks transactions, and produces market reports. But it does not pick up the phone, does not hold an AI conversation on WhatsApp, and does not build your website. BirkyStudio does the work: it answers, it follows up, it qualifies, 24/7, and it is a one-time build instead of a per-seat contract you rent forever.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 1 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/topproducer-article-1.jpg" alt="Real estate agent reviewing a client database on a laptop with a smartphone showing a new lead notification at a bright modern desk" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Why Compare -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:16px;">Why compare BirkyStudio and Top Producer?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        Top Producer and BirkyStudio get compared because both promise to cut the admin that eats a real estate agent's day, and because Top Producer is often the CRM an agent or brokerage already pays for. Top Producer has been in the market for decades, now owned by FiveStreet (Constellation), and it centers on contact management and real estate marketing: notes, categories, calendar sync, automated SMS and email lead response, drip campaigns, transaction management, and patented branded Market Snapshot reports pulled straight from MLS data. It connects to 320+ MLS boards, which is its clearest advantage. The catch is the model: it is priced per user, every month, on annual contracts that reviewers say are hard to cancel.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        BirkyStudio takes a different route. Instead of renting you a seat-based database to operate, we build and run an AI operator for you. The Base Agent reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it to a Notion CRM built for agents, answers it instantly, and follows up automatically, in English and Spanish. Add the AI Receptionist and the phone is answered 24/7. Add the Verified Prospect List and you get real, enriched, scored prospects you own forever.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px;">
        Both are answering the same complaint: too much admin, too little selling. But they answer it differently. One hands you a deep, established real estate platform and a per-seat bill that renews whether you use it or not. The other takes the work off your desk for a one-time build you own. The difference shows up in what you pay over time, what you own, what you give up, and who does the work at 9pm on a Saturday. That is what this page breaks down, honestly, including where Top Producer wins.
      </p>

      <!-- Comparison Table -->
      <h2 id="comparison" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">BirkyStudio vs Top Producer, Side by Side</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
