              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Not an MLS-based platform</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ 320+ MLS boards, branded Market Snapshot reports</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Real Estate Specific Tools</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> AI and Notion CRM, not a full RE-CRM feature set</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Transaction management, MLS reports, drip campaigns</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Website Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ $499 / $999 / $1,999 one-time, you own the code</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Add-on at $35/user/month, IDX extra via third party</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Support</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Same person who built it, plus optional care plans</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">⚠️</span> Phone, chat, and knowledge base, mixed reviews</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Who Does the Work</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ The AI answers and follows up, we maintain it</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✕ You do, it is a tool you operate</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Track Record</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Smaller, newer studio</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ 20+ years, huge user base, deep MLS coverage</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 2 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/topproducer-article-2.jpg" alt="Close-up of a laptop screen showing a clean CRM contact pipeline with a coffee cup on a wooden desk" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Detailed Review: BirkyStudio -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:32px;">Detailed Reviews</h2>

      <div id="birky-studio" style="background:rgba(255,45,149,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <span style="background:var(--bs-accent);color:white;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">IT WORKS FOR YOU</span>
          <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0;">BirkyStudio</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio is not a CRM you log into and work. It is an operator that runs in the background. The Base Agent ($1,297 solo, from $2,997 for a team) reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it to a Notion CRM built for agents, answers it instantly, and follows up automatically, in English and Spanish. The CRM is included free, so you are not paying a per-seat subscription for a database.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Add the AI Receptionist and the front desk is covered around the clock. The Text Receptionist for WhatsApp is $297 one-time and holds real AI conversations. The Voice Receptionist is $550 one-time, plus you pay Vapi directly for usage (about $30 to $50 a month), and it answers calls 24/7 in both languages. Add a Verified Prospect List ($497 Starter, $997 Pro, one-time) and you start with real, enriched, scored prospects you own forever, no bots and no dead numbers. The $1,997 Lead Generation Pack ties it together: the list, automated outreach, an AI agent trained on your pitch, and the receptionist that catches every reply.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Where it wins is time, ownership, and the shape of the bill. Nothing waits for you to sit down. A lead that comes in at 9pm gets an answer at 9pm, not the next morning. And everything is one-time or optional, so there is no per-seat fee, no annual renewal, and no cancellation maze.
        </p>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Pros</p>
            <ul style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>AI answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7, EN/ES</li>
              <li>Follow-up happens automatically, no sitting down to work it</li>
              <li>Verified, enriched, scored prospects you own forever</li>
              <li>Notion CRM included free with the Base Agent</li>
              <li>Websites you own and can edit ($499 / $999 / $1,999)</li>
              <li>One-time builds, no per-seat fee, no annual contract</li>
              <li>No setup fee, no contract, 30-day money-back guarantee</li>
              <li>Same person who built it answers your support</li>
              <li>Works for any niche, not just real estate</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Cons</p>
            <ul style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Higher upfront cost than one month of Top Producer</li>
              <li>No MLS integration and no branded Market Snapshot reports</li>
